    qa:commitSha "70cce09715406773fe7376fa4708a979dd61e2cd" ;
    qa:status "open" ;
    qa:note "Confirmed: 70cce097 is the exact commit that deleted SendRequestEnvelope::Compose/Acknowledge (protocol.rs diff in this commit), and the same commit left docs/atm-daemon/protocol-icd.md:329-411 untouched (not in the commit's changed-file list). Stale text present verbatim on this branch." .

